WEBVTT

NOTE The card's words, one cue per spoken line, byte for byte from content/card.txt. The paper on screen carries the words; this track is the accessibility track, never burned in.

1
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.758
THREE RULES FOR LIVING FROM THE LORD'S PRAYER:

2
00:00:07.008 --> 00:00:13.909
1. Confess all sins to God (Tell it) daily.

3
00:00:14.159 --> 00:00:18.834
2. Surrender your will to God daily.

4
00:00:19.084 --> 00:00:25.096
3. Forgive others and yourself daily.

5
00:00:25.346 --> 00:00:30.310
Dear friend, rule 1 is the key to our success.

6
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:37.675
When we can't do rule 2 or 3, we must always go to rule 1 and confess it; God will forgive...

7
00:00:37.925 --> 00:00:44.781
We must never stop confessing, even if they are the same old sins we can't seem to stop doing.

8
00:00:45.031 --> 00:00:48.899
As we practice these rules everyday...

9
00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:52.019
God will change our lives.

10
00:00:52.269 --> 00:00:57.098
Also, practice the following little prayer all day:

11
00:00:57.348 --> 00:01:07.970
Lord Jesus, please pour out your mercy, salvation, and deliverance from evil upon everyone I see.

12
00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:15.943
See The Other Side Of This Card For More Help.

13
00:01:16.193 --> 00:01:29.963
Dear friend, if you're not sure where you'll spend eternity, and you want to know now, please pray this simple prayer from the bottom of your heart; as he heard my prayer, He will hear yours also.

14
00:01:30.213 --> 00:01:41.941
Dear Lord Jesus, I understand I am a sinner; I also believe You died for my sins and Your Father in Heaven raised you from the dead.

15
00:01:42.191 --> 00:01:48.198
I simply ask You to have mercy on my life and save my soul.

16
00:01:48.448 --> 00:01:55.001
Come into my heart and my life and take me to Your home someday.

17
00:01:55.251 --> 00:01:59.747
In Your Name Lord Jesus I pray and thank You.

18
00:01:59.997 --> 00:02:02.484
Amen.

19
00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:06.060
For continuous help from God, see other side...

